{"suttaId":"tha-ap448","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[931,948],"vripara":"36"},"segments":{"tha-ap448:0.3":"Ambāṭakiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap448:1.1":"“Supupphitaṃ sālavanaṃ, ogayha vessabhū muni;","tha-ap448:1.3":"Nisīdi giriduggesu, abhijātova kesarī.","tha-ap448:2.1":"“Pasannacitto sumano, ambāṭakamapūjayiṃ;","tha-ap448:2.3":"Puññakkhettaṃ anuttaraṃ [mahāvīraṃ (sī. syā.)], pasanno sehi pāṇibhi.","tha-ap448:3.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap448:3.3":"Duggati nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap448:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap448:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap448:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap448:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ambāṭakiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap448:8.1":"Ambāṭakiyattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
